{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specimen</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you play as a young girl born and raised inside a secret military research facility. Used as a living experiment in a classified bio-engineering project, you\u2019ve only ever known the cold walls of the lab\u2026 and the creatures locked away behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the creatures has escaped.<br>The soldiers have fled.<br>The base has collapsed into chaos.<br>And you\u2019re finally free \u2014 but not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of the facility, sneak past horrifying mutants, scavenge for supplies, and find a way out. But the deeper you go, the more you uncover what they did to you\u2026 and what you truly are.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650000?t=1757284143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650000?t=1757284143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650000/273ac777592cbf664bc24e7a2a5101100adcbdf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757284143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650000/273ac777592cbf664bc24e7a2a5101100adcbdf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757284143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all audiences.\r\n\r\nIt includes:\r\n- Intense violence (blood, dismemberment, attacks from mutant creatures)\r\n- A dark, oppressive atmosphere\r\n- Themes of captivity, human experimentation, and psychological trauma\r\n- Disturbing sounds and visual effects designed to induce fear and stress\r\n- There is no sexual content, nudity, or depictions of substance abuse or sexual assault."},"detailed_description":"<p c